{"data": {"id": 1400627895, "totalResults": 93, "items": [{"quote": "Elden Ring is the real next step for souls-like standards. It is unlike anything FromSoftware has created before, displaying an uncanny world that will keep on wowing players even as they pile up more and more hours of gameplay. Elden Ring is, thus, a prime candidate to become the 2022 GOTY.\r\n", "score": 100, "url": "https://areajugones.sport.es/videojuegos/analisis-elden-ring-la-mesa-redonda-tiene-nuevo-rey-arturo/", "date": "2022-02-23", "author": "", "authorSlug": null, "image": null, "publicationName": "Areajugones", "publicationSlug": "areajugones", "reviewedProduct": {"id": 1400627895, "type": "games", "title": "Elden Ring", "url": "/game/elden-ring/", "criticScoreSummary": {"url": "/game/elden-ring/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5", "score": 96}, "platform": {"id": 1500000062, "name": "PlayStation 5"}, "gameTaxonomy": {"game": {"id": 1400627895, "name": "Elden Ring"}, "platform": {"id": 1500000062, "name": "PlayStation 5"}}}, "platform": "PlayStation 5"}, {"quote": "Elden Ring is a crowning achievement of over a decade of Miyazaki\u2019s and FromSoftware\u2019s work, and an amazing example of how to find a whole new level of fun in a well-known and somewhat worn-out formula. The open world turned out to be a perfect fit for the genre and you can still tell this masterpiece was created by the famous Japanese studio. I honestly haven\u2019t been so excited about a game since the first Dark Souls.", "score": 100, "url": "https://cdaction.pl/recenzje/recenzja-elden-ring-to-nie-jest-dark-souls-iv-to-cos-znacznie-wiecej", "date": "2022-02-23", "author": "", "authorSlug": null, "image": null, "publicationName": "CD-Action", "publicationSlug": "cd-action", "reviewedProduct": {"id": 1400627895, "type": "games", "title": "Elden Ring", "url": "/game/elden-ring/", "criticScoreSummary": {"url": "/game/elden-ring/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5", "score": 96}, "platform": {"id": 1500000062, "name": "PlayStation 5"}, "gameTaxonomy": {"game": {"id": 1400627895, "name": "Elden Ring"}, "platform": {"id": 1500000062, "name": "PlayStation 5"}}}, "platform": "PlayStation 5"}, {"quote": "An uncompromising vision of wonder and terror, Elden Ring is the ultimate dark fantasy odyssey.", "score": 100, "url": "https://culturedvultures.com/elden-ring-ps5-review/", "date": "2022-02-23", "author": "", "authorSlug": null, "image": null, "publicationName": "Cultured Vultures", "publicationSlug": "cultured-vultures", "reviewedProduct": {"id": 1400627895, "type": "games", "title": "Elden Ring", "url": "/game/elden-ring/", "criticScoreSummary": {"url": "/game/elden-ring/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5", "score": 96}, "platform": {"id": 1500000062, "name": "PlayStation 5"}, "gameTaxonomy": {"game": {"id": 1400627895, "name": "Elden Ring"}, "platform": {"id": 1500000062, "name": "PlayStation 5"}}}, "platform": "PlayStation 5"}, {"quote": "As an experience, it's one of the most wondrous and open-ended games I've played in years.", "score": 100, "url": "https://www.destructoid.com/reviews/review-elden-ring/", "date": "2022-02-23", "author": "", "authorSlug": null, "image": null, "publicationName": "Destructoid", "publicationSlug": "destructoid", "reviewedProduct": {"id": 1400627895, "type": "games", "title": "Elden Ring", "url": "/game/elden-ring/", "criticScoreSummary": {"url": "/game/elden-ring/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5", "score": 96}, "platform": {"id": 1500000062, "name": "PlayStation 5"}, "gameTaxonomy": {"game": {"id": 1400627895, "name": "Elden Ring"}, "platform": {"id": 1500000062, "name": "PlayStation 5"}}}, "platform": "PlayStation 5"}, {"quote": "Elden Ring is a tour de force and is maybe the only example of a studio underselling a title. It's an M-rated Breath of the Wild, full of secrets, intrigue, and an enthralling world to explore. It's a game that makes me excited about gaming, and it's fantastic to see a highly anticipated title like this turn out so well. ", "score": 100, "url": "https://www.gamerevolution.com/review/702562-elden-ring-review-worth-buying-playing-ps4-ps5-pc-xbox-one-series-x-s", "date": "2022-02-23", "author": "", "authorSlug": null, "image": null, "publicationName": "Game Revolution", "publicationSlug": "game-revolution", "reviewedProduct": {"id": 1400627895, "type": "games", "title": "Elden Ring", "url": "/game/elden-ring/", "criticScoreSummary": {"url": "/game/elden-ring/critic-reviews/?platform=playstation-5", "score": 96}, "platform": {"id": 1500000062, "name": "PlayStation 5"}, "gameTaxonomy": {"game": {"id": 1400627895, "name": "Elden Ring"}, "platform": {"id": 1500000062, "name": "PlayStation 5"}}}, "platform": "PlayStation 5"}]}, "links": {"self": {"href": "https://backend.metacritic.com/reviews/metacritic/critic/games/elden-ring/web?offset=0&limit=5&sort=score&componentName=critic-reviews&componentType=ReviewList"}, "prev": {"href": null}, "next": {"href": "https://backend.metacritic.com/reviews/metacritic/critic/games/elden-ring/web?offset=5&limit=5&sort=score&componentName=critic-reviews&componentType=ReviewList"}, "first": {"href": "https://backend.metacritic.com/reviews/metacritic/critic/games/elden-ring/web?offset=0&limit=5&sort=score&componentName=critic-reviews&componentType=ReviewList"}, "last": {"href": "https://backend.metacritic.com/reviews/metacritic/critic/games/elden-ring/web?offset=90&limit=5&sort=score&componentName=critic-reviews&componentType=ReviewList"}, "filterOptions": [{"label": "All Reviews", "value": "all", "href": "https://backend.metacritic.com/reviews/metacritic/critic/games/elden-ring/web?offset=0&limit=5&sort=score&componentName=critic-reviews&componentType=ReviewList&filterBySentiment=all"}, {"label": "Positive Reviews", "value": "positive", "href": "https://backend.metacritic.com/reviews/metacritic/critic/games/elden-ring/web?offset=0&limit=5&sort=score&componentName=critic-reviews&componentType=ReviewList&filterBySentiment=positive"}, {"lab